      "form_language": "A single, calm rectangular slab with generous corner radii and a subtle chamfer around the top edge. The front face is kept almost entirely plain: a small, centred display window, a single intake grille band on the top face, and a bottom-edge USB-C opening. The look is deliberately utilitarian and tidy, with no part lines or decoration beyond the printed logo.",
